            <dt>User account</dt>
            <dd>Your Discord account and any account, identifier or hardware record associated with your ElPlugins access.</dd>
            <dt>HWID</dt>
            <dd>A hardware identifier used to associate access with a permitted device.</dd>
            <dt>Rules</dt>
            <dd>The ElPlugins Discord and community rules displayed during verification or published in the ElPlugins Discord server.</dd>
          </dl>
