            <li>authorise the ElPlugins Discord application;</li>
            <li>use a Discord account with an email address that Discord marks as verified;</li>
            <li>accept the current ElPlugins Rules;</li>
            <li>accept the current version of these Terms; and</li>
            <li>acknowledge the Privacy Notice.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>After you successfully authorise Discord and pass the verification checks, ElPlugins may record:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>your Discord user ID;</li>
            <li>your Discord username and display name;</li>
            <li>your Discord email address;</li>
            <li>whether Discord marks your email address as verified;</li>
            <li>the IP address used to complete verification;</li>
            <li>verification dates and times;</li>
            <li>the versions of the Rules and Terms accepted;</li>
            <li>the Discord role-assignment result; and</li>
            <li>technical errors associated with role assignment.</li>
