          <ul>
            <li>30-, 60-, 90-day or lifetime Package access permits <strong>2 HWIDs</strong>;</li>
            <li>30-, 60-, 90-day or lifetime PVM access permits <strong>1 HWID</strong>; and</li>
            <li>combined Package and PVM access for 30, 60 or 90 days permits <strong>1 HWID</strong>.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To remove an HWID, you must either wait 30 days without activating the plugin or request an immediate reset.</p>
          <p>An immediate reset may be subject to the reset fee shown before the reset is confirmed. At the date these Terms were last reviewed, the standard immediate reset fee was USD $5 or the accepted equivalent in supported in-game currency or cryptocurrency.</p>
